; Associated-cube extraction by strong induction on the actual norm.
; Zero and units have direct root/unit witnesses. Every nonzero nonunit
; supplies an actual prime divisor. Removing its cube preserves the
; product equation and coprimality, strictly lowers the actual norm,
; and reconstructs an actual cube root/unit from the induction witness.
; No UFD, PID, cube-extraction or descent axiom is assumed.
